    "summary": "The pure-MSE ablation is statistically indistinguishable from the primary arm at the composite endpoint and sits nominally above it, so the pathway-prior terms show no measurable benefit on the frozen population endpoint. The manuscript must not attribute extrapolation level or stability to the pathway losses."
