  "interpretation_notes": [
    "Both arms are tagged runs of the identical frozen protocol on the frozen 2,991-gene panel, so this contrast is panel-matched and protocol-matched; unlike the classical-baseline tests it carries no 2,000-vs-2,991 caveat.",
    "Three stochastic training seeds give df = 2, so these tests are exploratory and their confidence intervals are wide.",
    "The pathway-prior terms are a training-time soft constraint, not an architectural component; a null here bounds their contribution to the frozen population endpoint and does not speak to other endpoints, datasets, or mechanistic readouts."
